## Why This Is Asked
Assesses practical knowledge of multi-tenant KCNA scaling, ordering guarantees, and zero-downtime rebalancing.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant partition ownership and fast-rebalancing
- Two-phase commit style fencing and graceful stop
- Ordering guarantees and exactly-once semantics across transfers
- Observability, canaries, rollback

## Code Example
